      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>Subay\u1e6d\u0131la</em>:\u00a0An ancient city of Ifr\u012bqiyya (<em>\u0130fr\u012b\u1e33iyye</em>), one of the capitals of those lands.\u00a0Afterwards Mahdiyya (<em>Mehdiyye</em>), it became the capital of Tunis (<em>T\u016bnis</em>).\u00a0Before Islam, it was the city of\u00a0Corcis, king of the Romans/Byzantines (<em>R\u016bm</em>). [translation]</p>",
